okspace stays small and plugs into the tools you already use.","/docs/integrations","integrations.md","en:shards.md","Shards","Shards are small programs that react to workspace events.","/docs/shards","shards.md","en:skills.md","Skills","A skill is a small, reusable workflow written for AI agents: a folder with a SKILL.md (YAML frontmatter name + description, then instructions) and optional reference files.","/docs/skills","skills.md","en:local-llm.md","Local LLM setup","Brokspace answers questions (brok ask) and runs skills (brok skill run) with any OpenAI-compatible model.","/docs/local-llm","local-llm.md","en:_1","Guides","en:getting-started.md","Getting started with Brokspace","From zero to a productive workspace in about 15 minutes.","/docs/getting-started","getting-started.md","en:index.mdx","Introduction","Brokspace makes any development workspace searchable and agent-ready, on your machine.","/docs","en:_0","Start","folder","","meta","meta.json"]
